<title>USA: U.S. cotton exports by class -- Commerce.</title>
<headline>U.S. cotton exports by class -- Commerce.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Commerce Department</p>
<p>cotton exports by class (running bales):</p>
<p> -		 Total  Upland-A  Upland-B  Upland-C   Am.Pima</p>
<p> -  Apr 97    679,809   92,423   492,827    79,842    14,717</p>
<p> -  Mar 97    811,926  103,574   576,417   110,645    21,290</p>
<p> -  Apr 96    552,882   86,688   365,819    89,325    11,050</p>
<p>A-Under 1 inch. B-1 inch to 1-1/8 inches. C-1-1/8 inches or more.</p>
